@startuml
actor Manager
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "REST API" as API
participant "Inventory Service" as SVC
database DB
Manager -> UI: Submit component form
UI -> API: POST /api/inventory
API -> SVC: Validate fields
SVC -> DB: Generate/check SKU
DB --> SVC: Unique SKU
SVC -> DB: Insert component
DB --> SVC: Created component
SVC --> API: 201 Created
API --> UI: Component + SKU
UI --> Manager: Show new component
@enduml
